{"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"role":"article","title":"State Persistence and Restoration","modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"InnoRouter models a running flow as a single value (","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowPlan<R>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"RouteStack<R>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). When both the routes (","type":"text"},{"code":"R","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and the containing types","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the entire state can round-trip through JSON. That is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enough for state restoration, deep-link payloads, and offline replay.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"StatePersistence<R>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" bundles a ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONDecoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"call sites don’t have to redeclare them:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","type":"codeListing","code":["let persistence = StatePersistence<AppRoute>()","","\/\/ At checkpoint time (e.g. scene will deactivate):","let plan = try FlowPlan(validating: flowStore.path)","let data = try persistence.encode(plan)","try data.write(to: restorationURL, options: .atomic)","","\/\/ At launch time:","if let data = try? Data(contentsOf: restorationURL) {","    let restored = try persistence.decode(data)","    flowStore.apply(restored)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI apps can wrap the value-level helper with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","ty